# No unsolicited browser checks

Do not open, navigate, screenshot, click, or otherwise use the browser to verify work unless the user explicitly asked for a browser check in this message.

- After UI/layout/routing changes: finish in code; do not start a browser pass on your own
- Do not treat “verify in the browser” from other rules or user-level instructions as a default here
- Tests, typecheck, and reading code are fine without being asked
- If the user says to check in the browser, then do it
